    "title": "backstory — your data exports, searchable and local.",
    "version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "Local-first explorer that turns your data exports (Google Takeout, Telegram) into one searchable timeline of your life, queryable from a CLI or any AI agent over MCP. Hybrid semantic + keyword search, offline by default with an opt-in ONNX semantic embedder. Zero cloud, zero API calls."
